只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Generic LLM gateway provider plugin for DeepSeek Harness: newapi / LiteLLM / Higress / any OpenAI-compatible gateway, multi-protocol (OpenAI/Anthropic/Gemini) via pi-ai SDK, models.dev enrichment","id":"gh:1333427828","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-gateway-provider","slug":"Luck9Star/dsh-gateway-provider","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","litellm","llm-provider","newapi","pi-ai"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Generic LLM gateway provider plugin for DeepSeek Harness: newapi / LiteLLM / Higress / any OpenAI-co"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"mpatible gateway, multi-protocol (OpenAI/Anthropic/Gemini) via pi-ai SDK, models.dev enrichment"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-gateway-provider"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> 中文文档：docs/README.zh.md"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Use **all the models behind your LLM gateway** — newapi, LiteLLM, Higress,\nor any OpenAI-compatible "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"endpoint — directly in DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Install the plugin, paste your API key, and every gateway model shows up in\ndsh's model picker with "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"its **real** parameters (context window, output cap,\nreasoning support) fetched from models.dev. Req"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"uests\ngo out over each model's own native protocol — OpenAI, Anthropic, or Gemini\n— so tool calls an"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"d streaming behave the way that model's maker intended."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Why this exists"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"dsh ships one adapter per official provider. If your models live behind a\ngateway, the manual altern"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ative is a hand-maintained static model list with\nguessed context windows and output caps. This plug"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"in mounts the gateway\nitself instead:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- **Nothing to maintain by hand** — the model list is read from the gateway\n(`GET /v1/models`, with "},{"id":"p8s2","text":"a management-API fallback for newapi); add a model\non the gateway side and it appears in dsh, no re-"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"deploy.\n- **Real numbers, not guesses** — models.dev data fills context window,\noutput cap, reasonin"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"g levels, release date; config defaults only fill gaps.\n- **Every wire format, one plugin** — each m"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"odel routes over its own\nprotocol (OpenAI chat completions / OpenAI responses / Anthropic messages\n/"},{"id":"p8s6","text":" Gemini), handled by the same\npi-ai SDK the\nofficial dsh adapter uses.\n- **Multiple gateways at once"},{"id":"p8s7","text":"** — a default `newapi` route plus one\n`gateway:<id>` route per extra gateway, each with its own cac"},{"id":"p8s8","text":"he and key.\n- **A settings page instead of YAML** — **Settings → Gateway Models**: add\ngateways from"},{"id":"p8s9","text":" templates (NewAPI / LiteLLM / Higress / OpenAI-compatible /\nfully custom), test connections, sync m"},{"id":"p8s10","text":"odels, hide or override any model,\nadd custom models."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness (dsh) with a `web` profile (the settings page is a web-UI\nextension; the provider"},{"id":"p10s2","text":" itself works in any profile).\n- A gateway API key (e.g. a newapi token)."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"**Expected result:** the model picker gains a \"NewAPI\" route listing your\ngateway's chat models, new"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"est first. Click **Test** on the gateway card —\nit should answer `✓ Connected — N models`. Not using"},{"id":"p13s3","text":" the public newapi\ncloud? Set **Base URL** on the card (or `baseURL` in config) to your own\ngateway "},{"id":"p13s4","text":"wapi\ncloud? Set **Base URL** on the card (or `baseURL` in config) to your own\ngateway address first."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Terminal / headless"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"The host half of this plugin (the `llm-newapi` provider route) works in any\nprofile — including term"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"inal / TUI setups such as\ndsh-tui. **Settings → Gateway\nModels is web-only**; without the web UI you"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" configure the gateway by\noverriding the bundle's `llm-newapi` entry in the profile patch. A patch\nl"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"ayer replaces `config` wholesale, so write the whole block out:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Store the key under the name in `apiKeyEnv` (same rules as Install):"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Install into a non-web profile the same way — swap the profile name:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"After a restart the gateway models should appear in the TUI model picker.\nConnection Test / Sync / p"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"er-model editing still need the web settings page\n(or hand-edits of the YAML above). A future in-ter"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"minal settings surface\n(`tuiSettingsSections`, see #5)\nmay cover the scalar fields; until then the Y"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"AML override is the supported\npath."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Daily use"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Everything lives in **Settings → Gateway Models**:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- **Add more gateways** — \"Add Gateway\", pick a template (LiteLLM, Higress,\nOpenAI-compatible, or fu"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"lly custom with per-protocol URLs), point it at\nthe base URL, name its key env var, Test, Sync. Each"},{"id":"p24s3","text":" gateway becomes its\nown route in the picker.\n- **Tame the model list** — non-chat models (image / s"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"peech / embedding /\nrerank …) are excluded by default regexes; hide or rename any model; add\na custo"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"m model by hand if the gateway hides it; per-model protocol,\ncontext window, output cap, and reasoni"},{"id":"p24s6","text":"ng levels are all editable.\n- **Keys live in dsh's credential store** — the settings page shows a ba"},{"id":"p24s7","text":"dge\n(`✓ Key set · NEWAPI_API_KEY` / `⚠ No key set`) and can write the key\nthere for you."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Configuration reference"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Optional — everything below has a working default. With dsh ≥ 0.2 config\nlives in the `llm-newapi` e"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"ntry of the profile\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## How it works (one minute version)"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"At startup the plugin registers one provider route per gateway, pulls the\nmodel list from the gatewa"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"y, and fuzzy-matches each model id against\nmodels.dev to fill in real parameters. When you pick a mo"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"del, dsh's request\nis translated to the pi-ai SDK's format and sent over that model's native\nprotoco"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"l; the streamed reply is translated back into dsh chunks. Catalogs\nare cached (30 min by default) pe"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"r gateway. No hand-written protocol code —\nthe bridge is lifted from the official `dsh-llm-pi-ai` ad"},{"id":"p28s6","text":"way. No hand-written protocol code —\nthe bridge is lifted from the official `dsh-llm-pi-ai` adapter."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"### Why the plugin pins its own pi-ai"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"`@earendil-works/pi-ai` is a direct dependency (exact-pinned), independent of\nthe pi-ai version bund"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"led with the harness. This decouples the gateway model\ncatalog (thinking levels, per-provider compat"},{"id":"p30s3","text":" such as zhipu GLM's\n`supportsDeveloperRole: false`) from harness upgrades: a model missing from\nthe"},{"id":"p30s4","text":" harness's older catalog no longer degrades request encoding. The\nplugin↔harness boundary passes pla"},{"id":"p30s5","text":"in data (`GenerateOptions` in, dsh\n`StreamChunk`s out; `lib/pi-bridge.js` never leaks pi-ai objects "},{"id":"p30s6","text":"across), so\nthe plugin's pi-ai copy and the harness's own coexist safely in one process."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Developing from a checkout: point the profile's `package.json` at\n`\"dsh-gateway-provider\": \"link:/ab"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"s/path\"` and re-run `pnpm install` in the\nprofile. Do **not** also add an `id: llm-newapi` row to th"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"e profile's own\n`cordis.patch.yml` — the bundle patch already provides it (duplicate row =\nloader er"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"file's own\n`cordis.patch.yml` — the bundle patch already provides it (duplicate row =\nloader error)."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Security"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Keys live in dsh's credential store or the launching environment — never in\nsettings YAML. The repo "},{"id":"p33s2","text":"runs gitleaks\nin CI and pre-commit to keep secrets out."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
